### 팀 멤버 초대
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}

### 팀 멤버 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 팀 멤버 여부 확인
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/members/1/exists

### 팀 멤버 역할 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/members/1/role
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "OWNER"
}

### 팀 멤버 내보내기 또는 팀 나가기
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/members/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
